    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internal Incident</strong> is a hardcore extraction shooter with survival horror elements.<strong>\u00a0 </strong>Navigate nightmare facilities that change with every deployment, managing ammo, batteries, and sanity as you piece together what caused the catastrophe. Play solo or in tense 4-player co-op, where every decision could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated</strong> \u2013 The facility changes every time you enter. Corridors shift, rooms rearrange, and dangers move. You\u2019ll never know what\u2019s waiting for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Light, ammo, and medical supplies are scarce. Every bullet counts, and the darkness is not your friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Consequences</strong> \u2013 Death means losing everything. Only successful extractions let you keep gear and progress further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong> \u2013 The most valuable secrets are hidden in the most dangerous areas. Will you play it safe or push deeper for bigger prizes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Squad Survival</strong> \u2013 Go in alone or team up with up to 3 others\u2014but remember, resources are limited, and not everyone will make it out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> \u2013 Find hidden documents, audio logs, and strange clues to uncover what really happened here\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> The complex does not forgive mistakes. Will you take the risk?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internal Incident</strong> is a hardcore extraction shooter with survival horror elements.<strong>\u00a0 </strong>Navigate nightmare facilities that change with every deployment, managing ammo, batteries, and sanity as you piece together what caused the catastrophe. Play solo or in tense 4-player co-op, where every decision could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated</strong> \u2013 The facility changes every time you enter. Corridors shift, rooms rearrange, and dangers move. You\u2019ll never know what\u2019s waiting for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Light, ammo, and medical supplies are scarce. Every bullet counts, and the darkness is not your friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Consequences</strong> \u2013 Death means losing everything. Only successful extractions let you keep gear and progress further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong> \u2013 The most valuable secrets are hidden in the most dangerous areas. Will you play it safe or push deeper for bigger prizes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Squad Survival</strong> \u2013 Go in alone or team up with up to 3 others\u2014but remember, resources are limited, and not everyone will make it out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> \u2013 Find hidden documents, audio logs, and strange clues to uncover what really happened here\u2026 if you survive long enough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> The complex does not forgive mistakes. Will you take the risk?</p>",
